      "doc": "doc_1",
      "category": "src_content",
      "full_page": "Congratulations on your practical Write in the \"Priest.\" Too bad you could'nt have it in a hundred publications. Miss Beatrice McCahill was over from Chicago, 7612 N. Ashland. She promised a $100 for your Seminary some time ago if she got a certain favor. Here with you'll find same. Delighted to give the surprise. I am trying to get it off To-Day. God help us! I hardly seem to be getting anything done - any- yet so much to be done. I am often at my wits' end what to do first. .... God bless us all.",
